  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>scalar-scale-map · 4×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1024 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-dataframe-scalar-scale-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-dataframe-scalar-scale-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const valuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; values: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const domainOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; domain: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const rangeOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; range: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const outputValuesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const outputValidityOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"16\">@group(0) @binding(5) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputValidity: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const MAXIMUM_DOMAIN_COUNT: u32 = 2u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">fn scalarIsFinite(value: f32) -&gt; bool {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">fn scalarTransform(value: f32, scale: u32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  if (scale == 1u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">    return select(sqrt(abs(value)), -sqrt(abs(value)), value &lt; 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  if (scale == 2u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">    // For negative log domains d3 uses -log(-x); the sign cancels in normalization.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">    return log(abs(value));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  return value;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">fn scalarInterpolate(first: f32, second: f32, position: f32) -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  if (position == 0.0) { return first; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  if (position == 1.0) { return second; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  // Same convex interpolation convention as d3; unlike first+(second-first)*t this\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  // remains finite for opposite large endpoints when the result is in range.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  return first * (1.0 - position) + second * position;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"41\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"42\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  _ = &amp;values;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  _ = &amp;domain;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  _ = &amp;range;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  _ = &amp;outputValues;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  _ = &amp;outputValidity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  let nullValue = parameters[parametersOffset + 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  outputValues[outputValuesOffset + index] = select(0.0, nullValue, scalarIsFinite(nullValue));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  outputValidity[outputValidityOffset + index] = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  let scaleParameter = parameters[parametersOffset];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  let domainCountParameter = parameters[parametersOffset + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">  if (!scalarIsFinite(scaleParameter) || !scalarIsFinite(domainCountParameter) || !scalarIsFinite(nullValue)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  if (scaleParameter &lt; 0.0 || scaleParameter &gt; 4.0 || floor(scaleParameter) != scaleParameter || domainCountParameter &lt; 0.0 || domainCountParameter &gt; f32(MAXIMUM_DOMAIN_COUNT) || floor(domainCountParameter) != domainCountParameter) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  let invertParameter = parameters[parametersOffset + 3u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  if (invertParameter != 0.0 &amp;&amp; invertParameter != 1.0) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  if (invertParameter == 1.0 &amp;&amp; scaleParameter != 3.0) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  let scale = u32(scaleParameter);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  let domainCount = u32(domainCountParameter);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  let value = values[valuesOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">  if (!scalarIsFinite(value)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">  var mapped: f32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  if (scale == 4u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">    if (domainCount == 0u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">    let firstRange = range[rangeOffset];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">    let secondRange = range[rangeOffset + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">    if (!scalarIsFinite(firstRange) || !scalarIsFinite(secondRange)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">    var categoryIndex = MAXIMUM_DOMAIN_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">    for (var candidate = 0u; candidate &lt; domainCount; candidate++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">      let category = domain[domainOffset + candidate];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">      if (!scalarIsFinite(category)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">      if (category == value &amp;&amp; categoryIndex == MAXIMUM_DOMAIN_COUNT) { categoryIndex = candidate; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">    if (categoryIndex == MAXIMUM_DOMAIN_COUNT) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">    let position = select(0.5, f32(categoryIndex) / f32(max(domainCount - 1u, 1u)), domainCount &gt; 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">    mapped = scalarInterpolate(firstRange, secondRange, position);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">  } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">    if (domainCount != 2u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">    let firstDomain = domain[domainOffset];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">    let secondDomain = domain[domainOffset + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    if (!scalarIsFinite(firstDomain) || !scalarIsFinite(secondDomain)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">    if (scale == 2u &amp;&amp; !((firstDomain &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; secondDomain &gt; 0.0) || (firstDomain &lt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; secondDomain &lt; 0.0))) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">    if (scale == 3u &amp;&amp; invertParameter == 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">      mapped = select(value, firstDomain, firstDomain == secondDomain);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">      let firstRange = select(range[rangeOffset], secondDomain, scale == 3u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">      let secondRange = select(range[rangeOffset + 1u], firstDomain, scale == 3u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">      if (!scalarIsFinite(firstRange) || !scalarIsFinite(secondRange)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">      if (firstDomain == secondDomain) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">        mapped = select(scalarInterpolate(firstRange, secondRange, 0.5), firstDomain, scale == 3u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">      } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">        if (scale == 2u &amp;&amp; ((value &lt;= 0.0 &amp;&amp; firstDomain &gt; 0.0) || (value &gt;= 0.0 &amp;&amp; firstDomain &lt; 0.0))) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">        let first = scalarTransform(firstDomain, scale);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">        let second = scalarTransform(secondDomain, scale);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">        let transformed = scalarTransform(value, scale);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">        if (!scalarIsFinite(first) || !scalarIsFinite(second) || !scalarIsFinite(transformed) || first == second) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">        // Normalize large magnitudes before dividing: hardware may flush the reciprocal of\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">        // a near-maximum f32 denominator to zero even when the quotient is ordinary finite.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">        let magnitude = max(max(abs(first), abs(second)), abs(transformed));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">        let normalization = select(1.0, 1e-20, magnitude &gt; 1e19);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">        let scaledFirst = first * normalization;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">        let scaledSecond = second * normalization;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">        if (scaledFirst == scaledSecond) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">        let position = (transformed * normalization - scaledFirst) / (scaledSecond - scaledFirst);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">        if (!scalarIsFinite(position)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">        if (scale == 3u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">          // Keep both interpolation operands normalized too: GPU algebraic optimization may\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">          // form their difference, which overflows for opposite near-maximum f32 endpoints.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">          mapped = scalarInterpolate(second * normalization, first * normalization, position) / normalization;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">        } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">          mapped = scalarInterpolate(firstRange, secondRange, position);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">  if (!scalarIsFinite(mapped)) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">  outputValues[outputValuesOffset + index] = mapped;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">  outputValidity[outputValidityOffset + index] = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>values<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"poverty150Pct\">poverty150Pct</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>domain<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"domain\">domain</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>range<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"range\">range</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"parameters\">parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>outputValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"radius\">radius</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>outputValidity<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"radiusValidity\">radiusValidity</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUScalarScale/finite-float32 · main · 36cca046</figcaption></figure></section>",
